    {
      "example": "zh-CN",
      "help_en": "The language in which you want to return the description of the access control policy. Valid values:\n\nzh-CN (default value): Chinese\nen: English\nja: Japanese\n\nThis parameter is valid only for system access control policies",
      "help_zh": "指定返回结果中管控策略描述的语言。取值：\n\nzh-CN（默认值）：中文。\nen：英文。\nja：日文。\n\n该参数仅在系统管控策略时有效",
